{
  "version": "4.0.0",
  "language": "zh-Hant",
  "language_raw": "Trad_Chinese",
  "source": "message/dat/Trad_Chinese/script/ajito_doku_010.dat",
  "paired_tbl": "message/dat/Trad_Chinese/script/ajito_doku_010.tbl",
  "matching": "TRAILING_MAX_SENTINEL",
  "entries": [
    {
      "ordinal": 0,
      "label": "ajito_doku_010_sitappa_01",
      "hash64": "FE3FE6E5CC9BDE5B",
      "text": "……行行好，你能不能快點回去？[VAR 0x0114(002F)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 15,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "002F"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 1,
      "label": "ajito_doku_010_student_01",
      "hash64": "8FC7CE649BB09D04",
      "text": "我不走！\\n我想見毒幫班老大秋明閣下！",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 2,
      "label": "ajito_doku_010_sitappa_02",
      "hash64": "FE3FE7E5CC9BE00E",
      "text": "我說過了，他本人有吩咐我！\\n除了隊員以外，不准放行任何人！[VAR 0x0114(002F)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 29,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "002F"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 3,
      "label": "ajito_doku_010_student_02",
      "hash64": "8FC7D1649BB0A21D",
      "text": "我一定要見他！\\n我有話要和秋明閣下說！",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 4,
      "label": "ajito_doku_010_sitappa_03",
      "hash64": "FE3FE8E5CC9BE1C1",
      "text": "你就饒了我吧……[VAR 0x0114(002F)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 8,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "002F"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 5,
      "label": "ajito_doku_010_system_01",
      "hash64": "C90A82F2B8B9430C",
      "text": "似乎有人起了爭執。\\n……要怎麼辦？",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 6,
      "label": "ajito_doku_010_select_01",
      "hash64": "D6C26E8EEA4346BF",
      "text": "搭話",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 7,
      "label": "ajito_doku_010_select_02",
      "hash64": "D6C26F8EEA434872",
      "text": "靠近看看",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 8,
      "label": "ajito_doku_010_student_03",
      "hash64": "8FC7D0649BB0A06A",
      "text": "咦？",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 9,
      "label": "ajito_doku_010_sitappa_04",
      "hash64": "FE3FE9E5CC9BE374",
      "text": "啊～啊～\\n又來了一個麻煩。[VAR 0x0114(002F)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 13,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "002F"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 10,
      "label": "ajito_doku_010_sitappa_05",
      "hash64": "FE3FEAE5CC9BE527",
      "text": "天星隊的新人\\n原來這麼難當……[VAR 0x0114(002F)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 15,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "002F"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 11,
      "label": "ajito_doku_010_student_04",
      "hash64": "8FC7CB649BB097EB",
      "text": "……等等，這位手下！\\n這個人不是[VAR 0x0100(0000)]嗎？",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 16,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0100",
          "args_hex": [
            "0000"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 12,
      "label": "ajito_doku_010_sitappa_06",
      "hash64": "FE3FEBE5CC9BE6DA",
      "text": "[VAR 0x0100(0000)]……\\n那個挑釁天星隊的傢伙？[VAR 0x0114(002F)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 0,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0100",
          "args_hex": [
            "0000"
          ]
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 18,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "002F"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 13,
      "label": "ajito_doku_010_select_03",
      "hash64": "D6C2708EEA434A25",
      "text": "沒錯",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 14,
      "label": "ajito_doku_010_select_04",
      "hash64": "D6C2698EEA433E40",
      "text": "我來踢館的",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 15,
      "label": "ajito_doku_010_student_05",
      "hash64": "8FC7CA649BB09638",
      "text": "……果然沒錯！",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 16,
      "label": "ajito_doku_010_sitappa_07",
      "hash64": "FE3FECE5CC9BE88D",
      "text": "哇～糟糕～！[VAR 0x0114(002F)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 6,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "002F"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 17,
      "label": "ajito_doku_010_sitappa_08",
      "hash64": "FE3FDDE5CC9BCF10",
      "text": "基地的那幫人昨天打電動打通宵，\\n現在一定還在睡……[VAR 0x0114(002F)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 25,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "002F"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 18,
      "label": "ajito_doku_010_student_06",
      "hash64": "8FC7CD649BB09B51",
      "text": "……這裡就交給我！\\n這位手下，你快去叫醒夥伴吧！",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 19,
      "label": "ajito_doku_010_sitappa_09",
      "hash64": "FE3FDEE5CC9BD0C3",
      "text": "欸？你為什麼要幫忙？[VAR 0x0114(002F)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 10,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "002F"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 20,
      "label": "ajito_doku_010_student_07",
      "hash64": "8FC7CC649BB0999E",
      "text": "要是基地毫無防備的話，\\n秋明閣下也會很危險不是嘛！",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 21,
      "label": "ajito_doku_010_student_08",
      "hash64": "8FC7C7649BB0911F",
      "text": "秋明閣下是我的恩人，\\n也是我的同胞……！",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 22,
      "label": "ajito_doku_010_student_09",
      "hash64": "8FC7C6649BB08F6C",
      "text": "有危機的時候，\\n排除萬難火速前往是理所當然！！",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 23,
      "label": "ajito_doku_010_sitappa_10",
      "hash64": "FE42EBE5CC9E1CB1",
      "text": "雖然我不太懂你在說什麼，\\n但你幫了我一個大忙！[VAR 0x0114(002F)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 23,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "002F"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 24,
      "label": "ajito_doku_010_student_10",
      "hash64": "8FC449649BAD852E",
      "text": "想對我同胞不利的奸詐之徒，\\n就由我來當[VAR 0x1100(00FF,0101)]你妳的對手！",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 19,
          "count": 3,
          "code_hex": "1100",
          "args_hex": [
            "00FF",
            "0101"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 25,
      "label": "ajito_doku_010_select_05",
      "hash64": "D6C26A8EEA433FF3",
      "text": "沒問題",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 26,
      "label": "ajito_doku_010_select_06",
      "hash64": "D6C26B8EEA4341A6",
      "text": "等等！",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 27,
      "label": "ajito_doku_010_student_11",
      "hash64": "8FC44A649BAD86E1",
      "text": "君子不立於危牆之下。\\n真是非常明智的判斷！",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 28,
      "label": "ajito_doku_010_student_12",
      "hash64": "8FC447649BAD81C8",
      "text": "看招呀呀呀啊！",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 29,
      "label": "ajito_doku_010_student_13",
      "hash64": "8FC448649BAD837B",
      "text": "秋明閣下……對不起……",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 30,
      "label": "ajito_doku_010_nelke_01",
      "hash64": "5F2032885202D340",
      "text": "[VAR 0x0100(0000)]，[VAR 0x1100(00FF,0101)]你妳沒事吧！？[VAR 0x0114(001E)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 0,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0100",
          "args_hex": [
            "0000"
          ]
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 5,
          "count": 3,
          "code_hex": "1100",
          "args_hex": [
            "00FF",
            "0101"
          ]
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 17,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "001E"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 31,
      "label": "ajito_doku_010_nelke_02",
      "hash64": "5F2035885202D859",
      "text": "我一直監視著基地，\\n但突然騷動了起來。[VAR 0x0114(001E)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 19,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "001E"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 32,
      "label": "ajito_doku_010_nelke_03",
      "hash64": "5F2034885202D6A6",
      "text": "我擔心是不是發生了什麼事，\\n所以趕來這裡……[VAR 0x0114(001E)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 22,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "001E"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 33,
      "label": "ajito_doku_010_student_14",
      "hash64": "8FC44D649BAD8BFA",
      "text": "嗚嗚……！\\n竟然在這時候出現生力軍……！！",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 34,
      "label": "ajito_doku_010_nelke_04",
      "hash64": "5F2037885202DBBF",
      "text": "他是……我們學校的學生？\\n看起來不像是天星隊的人……[VAR 0x0114(001E)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 26,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "001E"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 35,
      "label": "ajito_doku_010_student_15",
      "hash64": "8FC44E649BAD8DAD",
      "text": "我不是天星隊的人……\\n但是秋明閣下是我的同胞！",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 36,
      "label": "ajito_doku_010_student_16",
      "hash64": "8FC44B649BAD8894",
      "text": "我無論如何都得見到他！",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 37,
      "label": "ajito_doku_010_nelke_05",
      "hash64": "5F2036885202DA0C",
      "text": "……看來背後有些理由。[VAR 0x0114(001E)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 11,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "001E"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 38,
      "label": "ajito_doku_010_nelke_06",
      "hash64": "5F2039885202DF25",
      "text": "我來聽聽他怎麼說。\\n[VAR 0x0100(0000)]，基地就先交給[VAR 0x1100(00FF,0101)]你妳了。[VAR 0x0114(001E)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 10,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0100",
          "args_hex": [
            "0000"
          ]
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 21,
          "count": 3,
          "code_hex": "1100",
          "args_hex": [
            "00FF",
            "0101"
          ]
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 30,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "001E"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 39,
      "label": "ajito_doku_010_nelke_07",
      "hash64": "5F2038885202DD72",
      "text": "好，我們走吧。\\n放心，我不會讓你吃虧的。[VAR 0x0114(001E)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 20,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "001E"
          ]
        }
      ]
    }
  ]
}
